rules_json.description:
List of pronunciation rules. Rule can be either:
    an alias rule: {'string_to_replace': 'a', 'type': 'alias', 'alias': 'b', }
    or a phoneme rule: {'string_to_replace': 'a', 'type': 'phoneme', 'phoneme': 'b', 'alphabet': 'ipa' } JSON-encoded value. Shape: [[{"string_to_replace (required)":"string","case_sensitive":"boolean","word_boundaries":"boolean","type (required)":"string","alias (required)":"string"},{"string_to_replace (required)":"string","case_sensitive":"boolean","word_boundaries":"boolean","type (required)":"string","phoneme (required)":"string","alphabet (required)":"string"}]]
